N2  - Summary Chapter 16 focuses on the vital role of cybersecurity training and awareness in the context of space operations. As space systems become increasingly interconnected and reliant on digital technologies, the risks associated with cyber threats escalate. This chapter outlines a comprehensive approach to developing effective training programs tailored for personnel involved in space missions. It discusses the unique cybersecurity challenges specific to the space domain, including satellite communications, ground control systems, and data integrity. Additionally, the chapter emphasizes the importance of fostering a robust security culture through continuous awareness initiatives and simulations that prepare teams for real-world scenarios. By prioritizing cybersecurity education, organizations can strengthen their defenses against potential cyberattacks and safeguard their critical space assets.
